[2026-03-16T02:48:33.522Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014U85YPEJdi7grhCnNAXsaF","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create a comprehensive report. Based on my findings, here's the information you requested:\n\n## Summary\n\n**1. App Directory Name:** \n`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n**2. Contents of docs/tests.md for User Profile Page:**\n\nThe User Profile page specification begins at line 1096 of `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`. It documents three main components:\n\n- **ProfileForm Component** (lines 1100-1156): Tests for displaying and editing user profile information including name, bio, phone, and avatar URL. Covers validation, persistence, and repeated edits.\n\n- **BecomeHostButton Component** (lines 1157-1183): Tests for the \"Become a Host\" button visibility and functionality, including confirmation dialogs and Redux state updates.\n\n- **UserReviewsList Component** (lines 1184-1220): Tests for displaying the user's written reviews in a dedicated section, including empty state, rating display, chronological ordering, and updates after new reviews.\n\nKey test cases include:\n- Profile page requires login\n- Displays current user info (name, email, bio, phone, avatar)\n- Inline editing of profile fields with PUT API calls\n- Validation for empty name and invalid avatar URLs\n- Email field is read-only\n- Profile updates persist across navigation\n- Become a Host button visibility based on is_host status\n- UserReviewsList shows reviews in reverse chronological order\n- Review cards link to property detail pages\n\n**3. Profile-Related Test Spec Files (*.spec.ts):**\n\nTwo test spec files are directly related to \"user profile\":\n\n1. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-form.spec.ts` - Tests for the ProfileForm component\n2. `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-host-reviews.spec.ts` - Tests for user reviews display on the profile\n\nThese files implement the specifications d